  "items": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "text": "The app keeps crashing on my phone every time I try to switch playlists. It's frustrating to have to restart the app just to listen to music."
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "Terrible. The price went up again and now I have to choose between streaming and other subscriptions. Not worth it anymore."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "Good music library, but the recommendations have gotten a bit repetitive lately. I keep seeing the same artists in my Discover Weekly."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "I like the interface, but the offline download limit is annoying. I can't save enough songs for my long commutes."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "Absolutely love it! The new audio quality settings are amazing, and the family plan is a great value for us. Best streaming service out there."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "Solid service overall. The podcasts are great, but I wish the integration with music was smoother. Sometimes it feels like two different apps."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "The shuffle feature is perfect for my workouts. I never have to think about what to play next, and the catalog is huge."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "Really enjoy the lyrics feature now. It's a nice touch. The only thing is, the app can be a bit slow to load on older devices."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "Customer support actually helped me fix my billing issue quickly. That was a pleasant surprise. The music selection is top tier."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "Decent, but the ads on the free tier are too intrusive. I'm considering switching to a competitor that offers a better free experience."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "The UI changes were confusing at first. I still can't find my favorite playlists easily. It feels less intuitive than before."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "text": "Perfect. The student discount makes it affordable, and the music quality is excellent. I use it for everything from studying to driving."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "text": "Love the new car integration. It connects seamlessly with my Bluetooth, and the audio quality is crisp. No complaints here."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "text": "The recommendation algorithm is spot on. It always finds new artists I end up loving. It feels like it really knows my taste."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "text": "Great service, but I wish there was more control over the shuffle. Sometimes it skips songs I really want to hear."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "text": "It's okay, but the app drains my battery quickly. I have to keep my phone plugged in while listening, which is a hassle."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "text": "The podcast section is growing, but the music recommendations have become generic. I feel like I'm stuck in a loop."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "text": "Price is a bit high for what you get. I'd like to see more exclusive content or better perks for loyal users."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "text": "Worst experience ever. My account got locked out and support took weeks to respond. I'm switching services immediately."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "text": "The family plan is a lifesaver. Everyone in the house has their own profile, and the music selection is unbeatable."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "text": "Good, but the offline mode is buggy. Songs sometimes disappear from my downloads without warning."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "text": "Love the new features! The ability to share playlists easily with friends is a great addition. Very user-friendly."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "text": "Solid choice. The music library is vast, and the app is stable. Just wish the price was a little lower."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "text": "Excellent. The audio quality is top-notch, and the app runs smoothly on all my devices. Highly recommend."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "text": "Perfect. The recommendations are always on point, and the user interface is clean and easy to navigate. No issues at all."
    }
  ]
